{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/07/26/itm_b7d677918338b1a5/index.md","canonical_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.21419v1","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-07-26T03:36:41Z","content_hash":"0c211c86ad7779e1d8ab6808b8e148dcfad87a7be73fe73f10fd6f0e99d707cc","evidence":[{"label":"PATS arXiv abstract","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.21419v1"},{"label":"PATS full PDF","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.21419v1"},{"label":"GRPO reference","type":"url","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.03300"}],"external_id":"arXiv:2607.21419v1","fetched_at":"2026-07-26T03:36:41Z","fingerprint":"0c211c86ad7779e1d8ab6808b8e148dcfad87a7be73fe73f10fd6f0e99d707cc","id":"itm_b7d677918338b1a5","item_id":"itm_b7d677918338b1a5","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","sort_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","source_id":"arxiv","source_name":"arXiv","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"PATS 将长程 Agent 的技能从部署时常驻知识改为训练期随策略能力变化的临时脚手架：它从同题 rollout 的成功/失败组构建证据卡，以任务成功率 EMA 和容量压力选择扩展、修订、压缩或强制裁剪，并只用环境回报进行 GRPO。Qwen2.5 1.5B/7B 在移除脚手架后相对 GRPO 的 ALFWorld 成功率提升 12.9/17.6 点、WebShop 成功率提升 3.5/18.6 点；七个搜索问答基准平均 45.2，比保留 SkillRL 技能库少 0.8 分但少用 32.1% prompt token。核心消融显示去掉 REVISE 下降 12.62 点；局限是主要验证在 ALFWorld、WebShop 和 Qwen2.5 上，受控移除实验覆盖有限，且训练需额外 7B refiner 与约 180 H20 GPU-hours 的审计运行成本。","tags":["llm-agent","post-training","grpo","reinforcement-learning","agentic-rl","scaffold"],"title":"PATS: Policy-Aware Training Scaffolding for Agentic Reinforcement Learning","title_hash":"7fc0ff16adf3a871b5d0aa6ce8eefc186faff4e484bc5a0118174d2c6eef6827","type":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.21419v1"}
